__pycache__/
*.pyc
kicad/*.kicad_prl
kicad/*-backups/
kicad/fp-info-cache
out/*.png
# the repository root ignores every "tools/" directory; this one holds the generator
!tools/
kicad/~*.lck
# the KiCad project of a build that failed, or whose board could not be checked (tools/build.py), to be looked at
out/failed/
out/unchecked/
# a half-done copy, if a build was stopped while it put the project into kicad/
.kicad-new-*/
# KiCad's own autosave and backup files, if the board is opened in KiCad
kicad/_autosave-*
kicad/#auto_saved_files#
kicad/*-bak
kicad/.history/
